OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over crash that left
OL,4,Atwo badly injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged following a
OL,7,Fcrash in Brighton Marina that left two
OL,8,Fpeople seriously injured, police have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,Freports of a disturbance outside
OL,13,FHollywood Bowl at about 22:30 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FTwo men, aged 22 and 30, were badly
OL,17,Fhurt in the crash with a black Range
OL,18,FRover, and the driver had left the
OL,19,Fscene, Sussex Police said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
