OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over crash that left
OL,4,Atwo badly injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 45-year-old man initially arrested
OL,7,Fhas been bailed while inquiries
OL,8,Fcontinue. A second man, 29-year-old
OL,9,FBradley Bell, of Forge Road, Three
OL,10,FBridges, was arrested on Monday and
OL,11,Flater charged with causing serious
OL,12,Finjury by dangerous driving, the force
OL,13,Fadded.
